  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop or crush garlic. In a medium saucepan, melt 1/2 the butter with a dash of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook 1/2 the garlic until fragrant, 1-2 mins. Add basmati rice, the water and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6228568102bfe246bc2255ae/step-ec86c706.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop onion. Grate carrot. Drain and rinse lentils.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over a medium-high heat.\n• Cook onion and carrot until softened, 4-5 mins. Add Persian spice blend and remaining garlic, and cook until fragrant, 1-2 mins.\n• Add lentils and cook until tender, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6228568102bfe246bc2255ae/step-36d52d74.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce the heat to medium, add coconut milk, vegetable stock and cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Stir in mixed leaves and remaining butter. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6228568102bfe246bc2255ae/step-ebb9a168.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Roughly chop herb leaves. In a small bowl, combine herbs and yoghurt. Season to taste.\n• Divide garlic rice and lentils between bowls.\n• Top with herby yoghurt.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6228568102bfe246bc2255ae/step-586497ae.jpg"
    }
  ]
